            "review_title": "Review at Tau Hu Xe Lam - Da Nang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "LF L\nHong Kong, China954 contributions\n0\nA dessert shop for Vietnam tofu\nMay 2024 • Family\nThis restaurant is for Vietnam desserts like tofu as well as for coffee. Dessert is more famous for this shop and the price is low. The tofu is topped with fruits and not sweat. It is served in room temperature with optional ice cube. Frankly, this restaurant is not very distinctive.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 12, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
