            "review_title": "Review at Tau Hu Xe Lam - Da Nang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "HazeSingapore\nSingapore278 contributions\n0\nPleasantly surprised\nJul 2022 • Family\nWalked past many roadside dessert stalls but was always hesitant to try cos they don’t look very clean. Was happy that on my last day in Da Nang I had a typical dessert experience in a clean place. Bean curd was very well made. Staff don’t speak English so I just had to point blindly at various pictures and hope for the best. They were excellent, especially the one with glutinous rice.\nRead more\nWritten July 9, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
