            "review_title": "Review at Tau Hu Xe Lam - Da Nang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sherry F\n43 contributions\n0\nLoved it!\nJan 2018 • Couples\nI love Vietnamese desserts and tofu so Tau Hu Xe Lam was perfect for me. They have many varieties of sweet tofu with different toppings (such as fruits, jellies or with ginger). They are about $1-2 USD per bowl. They also have a couple kinds of drinks too. It is very affordable. The seating area is cute and the staff were super nice. We came twice during our visit to Da Nang. The staff recognized us the second time. They were very friendly and offered us complimentary teas. It was a nice place to hang out after walking around all day and also when it began to rain lol.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 11, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
